"[[quarkus-oidc-client_quarkus-oidc-client-refresh-interval]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-oidc-client_quarkus-oidc-client-refresh-interval[`quarkus.oidc-client.refresh-interval`]##\n"
"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.oidc-client.refresh-interval+++[]\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"`quarkus.oidc-client.\"id\".refresh-interval`\n"
"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.oidc-client.\"id\".refresh-interval+++[]\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Token refresh interval. By default, OIDC client refreshes the token during the current request, when it detects that it has expired, or nearly expired if the `refresh-token-time-skew()` is configured. But, when this property is configured, OIDC client can refresh the token asynchronously in the configured interval. This property is only effective with OIDC client filters and other `AbstractTokensProducer` extensions, but not when you use the `OidcClient++#++getTokens()` API directly.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_OIDC_CLIENT_REFRESH_INTERVAL+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"[[quarkus-oidc-client_quarkus-oidc-client-refresh-interval]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-oidc-client_quarkus-oidc-client-refresh-interval[`quarkus.oidc-client.refresh-interval`]##\n"
"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.oidc-client.refresh-interval+++[]"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"`quarkus.oidc-client.\"id\".refresh-interval`\n"
"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.oidc-client.\"id\".refresh-interval+++[]"
msgstr ""

msgid "Token refresh interval. By default, OIDC client refreshes the token during the current request, when it detects that it has expired, or nearly expired if the `refresh-token-time-skew()` is configured. But, when this property is configured, OIDC client can refresh the token asynchronously in the configured interval. This property is only effective with OIDC client filters and other `AbstractTokensProducer` extensions, but not when you use the `OidcClient++#++getTokens()` API directly."
msgstr ""

msgid "Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_OIDC_CLIENT_REFRESH_INTERVAL+++[]"
msgstr ""

